WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.035
A star in the middle of its life.

00:02.735 --> 00:08.625
Our Sun is four and a half billion years old, and a little less than half way through its life.

00:09.075 --> 00:14.666
Deep inside, it turns hydrogen into helium, and that is what makes it shine.

00:15.116 --> 00:21.658
Nine stars in ten are in this steady middle age, which lasts for millions or billions of years.
